⍝ ---- printing
⍝ ᛗᚾ bit: the name of a mark bit
⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $borrowed$ ⎙̵ ⦄
  ⦃ ⍿⁰ #2# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $future$ ⎙̵ ⦄
    ⦃ ⍿⁰ #4# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $past$ ⎙̵ ⦄
      ⦃ ⍿⁰ #8# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $quantum$ ⎙̵ ⦄
        ⦃ ⍿⁰ #16# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $superposed$ ⎙̵ ⦄
          ⦃ ⍿⁰ #32# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $α$ ⎙̵ ⦄
            ⦃ ⍿⁰ #64# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $β$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ $γ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ᛗᚾ ⸫

⍝ ᛗᛈ mask: " marks=a,b" for the bits of mask, in name order
⦃
  ⧖:mask
  ⧗:mask ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ marks=$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:mask △ ⦶
  ⍝ the loop carries [mask bit first]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:mask,bit,first
    ⧗:mask ⧗:bit ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⧖:on
    ⧗:on ⧗:first ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ $,$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
    ⧗:bit ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ᛗᚾ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
    ⧗:mask ⧗:bit △ ≪ ⧗:first ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
    ⧗:bit #128# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ᛗᛈ ⸫
